    "aresKeywords": "area scale factor, linear scale factor, similar figures, enlargement, ASF, LSF, ratio of areas, similar rectangles, similar triangles, Unga Pembe, flour packet, school plan, Kisumu, scale drawing, squared scale factor, Grade 10 mathematics, KICD, similarity and enlargement, CBC Kenya, Core Mathematics"
