      "purposeInStoryline": "In Lesson 6 learners handle (or compute dimensions of) pairs of similar solids — sufuria cooking pots and the two school water tanks from the anchoring phenomenon. They tabulate LSF, ASF, and VSF, establish VSF = (LSF)³, and the group that predicted the water-tank capacity in Lesson 1 now confirms or corrects their Lesson 1 prediction. The three-way relationship is formalised and added to the Driving Question Board.",
