    "aresKeywords": "similarity, enlargement, linear scale factor, area scale factor, volume scale factor, LSF, ASF, VSF, scale drawing, map scale, Survey of Kenya, architectural plan, real-life application, model building, project launch, similar solids, Kisumu, Eldoret, mandazi, water tank, cardboard models, Kenya Grade 10, Core Mathematics, CBE, KICD, Strand 2.1"
